mdx_test.mdx is 1943kaia.mdx, an X68000 MDX arrangement of the Capcom 1943 Kai arcade music (title: [AC] (C)CAPCOM [ SOUND 20 ]), taken from DEViLBOX public/data/songs/mdx/ on 2026-11-04. The tune belongs to its original composer and Capcom; the file is used unchanged, only as the mdxmini-decode test fixture (row I699). It names no .pdx (the title line ends and the PDX name field is empty), so it needs no sample bank.
